<figure class="cache-figure" data-fleet-admission>
 <p class="figure-title">A local limit multiplies when the application scales</p>
 <div class="cache-controls"><label>Application processes <input data-processes type="range" min="1" max="8" value="4" /><output data-count></output></label><label><input data-partition type="checkbox" /> Divide the fixed fleet budget between processes</label></div>
 <p class="figure-note">Fleet budget: twelve active source operations · token refill sixty starts/s · burst twelve</p>
 <div class="fleet-processes" data-process-cards></div>
 <div class="fleet-totals"><p data-concurrency></p><p data-rate></p><p data-burst></p></div>
 <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>Without partitioning, every process receives the example’s four permits, twenty starts/s token refill and burst four. Partitioning divides fixed budgets evenly and rounds down. It is a static allocation, not a distributed limiter: a real rollout must coordinate membership and configuration, and a shared admission service has its own failure policy.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import{fleet}from'../../lib/caching/system-design.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-fleet-admission]').forEach(root=>{const processes=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-processes]')!,partition=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-partition]')!;const render=()=>{const s=fleet(Number(processes.value),partition.checked);root.querySelector('[data-count]')!.textContent=String(s.processes);root.querySelector('[data-process-cards]')!.innerHTML=Array.from({length:s.processes},(_,i)=>`<div><b>Process ${i+1}</b><span>${s.concurrency} permit${s.concurrency===1?'':'s'}</span><small>${s.rate}/s refill · burst ${s.burst}</small></div>`).join('');root.querySelector('[data-concurrency]')!.textContent=`${s.totalConcurrency} / 12 source permits allocated`;root.querySelector('[data-rate]')!.textContent=`${s.totalRate} / 60 starts/s refill allocated`;root.querySelector('[data-burst]')!.textContent=`${s.totalBurst} / 12 burst tokens allocated`;root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=partition.checked?`The static allocations fit all three fleet budgets. Rounding leaves ${12-s.totalConcurrency} permits and ${60-s.totalRate} starts/s unallocated. Idle capacity in one process is not automatically available to another.`:s.totalConcurrency>12?'These locally bounded processes collectively exceed the source budget. Autoscaling the application did not create more database capacity.':'These allocations fit the assumed fleet budget at this process count. Adding processes can change that result without changing any local setting.';};processes.oninput=render;partition.onchange=render;render();});
</script>
